    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d470">

                <pb facs="0477" n="471" sameAs="frus:frus1942v02/pg471"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">851T.00/55: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul at Dakar
                        (Flexer)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-12-03">December 3,
                        1942</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>127. Your 478, November 23 and 481, November 25.<anchor n="94" xml:id="d470-f1"/>
                    Department desires you to reopen office at once. You will of course appreciate
                        <pb facs="0478" n="472" xml:id="pg472"/> the necessity of the Consulate
                    functioning smoothly at this time. You should make every effort to adjust
                    locally any problems or difficulties which may have arisen as to your position
                    during the last few weeks, and to maintain satisfactory relations with the
                    constituted authorities of French West Africa.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
